fy so i don't ever purchase music  and when it comes to apps and games and  things like that i just find that it's  not a necessary expense now i do plan on  homeschooling and so i think that at  some point i will purchase certain apps  for things that i can't teach so for  example like piano lessons and things  like that i think the apps can be very  helpful but towards something that's  educational then i'm okay with  purchasing otherwise for entertainment  it's not for me suggested sale items  those are those sneaky items that are  right by the register when you're about  to purchase something you didn't intend  to purchase it you didn't go in there  thinking that you were gonna buy it so  you don't really need it number 14 is  shaving creams and depilatory creams  when it comes to shaving i just  basically use soap and follow up with  coconut oil and as far as depilatory  creams they are just toxic for your body  there's definitely not something that  you want to be putting on your skin  because your skin is the largest organ  of your body and it absorbs things so no  more depilatory creams for me in terms  of actually shaving my eczema has gotten  a lot better since i tried the keto diet  and so now i have a safety razor that i  purchased for like twenty dollars and  then a pack of a hundred blades that  basically i can shave for an entire year  for under ten dollars and all those  other things are unnecessary number  fifteen is notebooks you might not be  one of these individuals but i am a  sucker for notebooks and so now i have  decided i would limit to myself to only  purchasing a notebook when i need one no  matter how pretty the cover is number 16  is exercise equipment or clothes for  things that i have yet to start doing  but plan on doing them later someday  what i found is that at least for me  most of the time i never ended up doing  those things and i just have the expense  that would make me feel more guilty that  would make me feel less likely to 